exports[`visual: score > renders the hero score display 1`] = `
"kural (kural v0.0.0)

kural · score
path: all
branch: main
snapshot: active
────

Score:

◆ 0.74

Strong structural fit.
directory · 1 children

Glossary:

Self — how well this node fits under its parent (-1…1)
Children — how coherent this node's direct children are (-1…1)
Subtree — recursive health of the entire subtree below (-1…1)
Overall — harmonic mean of Self and Subtree (-1…1)
(—) — not applicable (leaves have no Children or Subtree)

Next steps:

kural score -e — detailed score breakdown table
kural score -p <path> — score a specific node or subtree
kural score -e -l 0 — show all rows in breakdown
kural score -c <id> — compare against a previous snapshot
kural score --json — output as JSON

"
`;

